OL,3,AUS removes all bombers from RAF
OL,4,AFairford base
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has withdrawn all of its bombers
OL,7,Ffrom RAF Fairford, the UK military base
OL,8,Fat the centre of an incident being
OL,9,Finvestigated by counter-terror police.
OL,11,FA statement from a Pentagon official
OL,12,Fconfirmed on Sunday it had removed its
OL,13,Fbombers - thought to be about a dozen
OL,14,FB-1s - from the base back to their home
OL,15,Fstations in America.
OL,17,FThe US did not give a reason for the
OL,18,Fwithdrawal, but it follows a major
OL,19,Fincident on 27 September when police
OL,20,Fwere alerted to three "suspicious
OL,21,Fvehicles" near the airbase.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
