OL,3,ABrazil election goes to run-off as
OL,4,Aright-wing Flavio Bolsonaro wins first
OL,5,Around
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe right-wing Flavio Bolsonaro has won
OL,8,Fthe first round of Brazil's
OL,9,Fpresidential election, beating the
OL,10,Fincumbent left-wing President Lula da
OL,11,FSilva, but falling short of the
OL,12,Foutright majority needed to win.
OL,14,FThere will be a run-off between the two
OL,15,Fcandidates on 25 October.
OL,17,FFlavio Bolsonaro is the son of the
OL,18,Fformer right-wing president Jair
OL,19,FBolsonaro, who is serving a 27-year
OL,20,Fprison sentence for masterminding a
OL,21,Ffailed coup after losing the 2022
OL,22,Felection.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
