OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump unveils 'Super Intelligence
OL,4,AForce' to oversee AI policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the president signed an
OL,7,Fexecutive order on 29 September to
OL,8,Frename AI as Super Intelligence, after
OL,9,Fpreviously saying the word artificial
OL,10,Fmade it sound "fake".
OL,12,FTrump also said last week that he would
OL,13,Fset up a board to oversee AI safety
OL,14,Fafter top tech bosses signed what he
OL,15,Fdescribed as a "morally binding"
OL,16,Fregulation pact.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
